radon-player-next
Radon Player Next: one codebase for the phone and the PC (Kotlin + Compose)

The start of the move from the Python/GTK PC app and the Kotlin phone app to one Kotlin codebase:
- shared/: the code both run alike, starting with the names code (norm, cleanTitle, similar, editions,
  singles, EPs, live names), with its tests; the phone app now builds on it
- desktop/: the PC app in Compose Multiplatform, on the shared code: your songs, searched as you type,
  played through mpv
2.0.0 stays on radon-player as it was.

